ned is that his essence  came to earth and it inhabited a human  host as did the essences of some of his  servants on apocalypse and so darkseid's  first host was a crime boss that went by  the name boss darkseid and then he  switched to dan turpin's body which he  altered to look like his original body  but regardless darkseid's plan is to  spread the anti-life equation to  everybody on earth and thereby conquer  the world and so to do that he needs to  eliminate the biggest threats to his  plan and of course that includes  superman so he arranges for an explosion  at the daily planet to mortally wound  lois lane forcing superman to travel to  the 31st century to find a way to save  her now superman is offered this chance  by zillow valla a member of a cosmic  race known as the monitors who are  basically in charge of maintaining order  throughout the dc multiverse obviously  they failed and so she tells superman  that lois can be healed by a substance  known as the bleed which she describes  as the material between the 52 universes  of the multiverse a drop of which is  capable of either healing or  annihilation but which only monitors can  touch and so superman goes with her of  course and he finds himself on a ship  with different versions of superman from  across the multiverse there's ultraman  the evil superman from earth 3 over man  a superman from a reality where the  germans won world war ii a quantum  superman from a universe where the laws  of physics are different and for some  reason a version of shazam now the ship  makes its way beyond the multiverse to a  place called limbo where they learn of  the threat that they've been recruited  to fight by reading a book made up of  every possible book now the book reveals  that in the beginning there was only one  entity known as the over monitor and the  over monitor finds a flaw within itself  and the over monitor sends a probe to  see what lies within the flaw and  discovers chaos in the forms of the  heroes villains lives deaths and stories  now here is where i should probably  point out that the entire purpose of the  superman beyond tie-in story to final  crisis is to allow grant morrison to  offer like a meta commentary on the  power of stories because that's the kind  of thing he likes to do but regardless  the over monitor decides that it has no  answer for the destruction that stories  would cause because stories were a  completely foreign concept to it and so  the over monitors probe withdraws and  the flaw is sealed by divine metals that  just so happen to take the shape of  superman which basically seals off the  multiverse where stories and narratives  are allowed to spread i told you this is  going to be kind of weird and a little  bit complicated but the monitors just  spend years looking at this giant metal  superman wondering is it here to protect  us or to harm us until the first  offspring of the original monitor a guy  known as dax novu decided to explore the  bleed and the flaw now dax novoo becomes  a sort of folk hero because it's  believed that he gave his life to bring  the monitor's knowledge of the bleeds  power and to lock away an entity known  as mandrak who's called the prime eater  of life now of course just as the  superman learn about all this a blast of  energy comes out of the book and they go  back to the ship and zillow valla  informs the group that mandrake the dark  monitor has risen and that he has found  them and that all is lost now ultraman  the evil superman from earth 3 then  reveals that he has read the last page  of the infinite book and that mandrak is  building a bridge from the void to the  multiverse and that his plan is to kill  everybody within the multiverse now  mandrax forces invade limbo and superman  and ultraman argue over whether they  should side with mandrak or fight him  and they eventually realize they both  need aspects of superman to power the  big metal superman that's supposed to be  protecting the multiverse so the quantum  superman fuses superman and ultraman  together and the big metal superman  which is called the cosmic armor  superman which i do have a full video on  if you want to watch it basically wakes  up now zillow valla explains that this  cosmic armor superman which she calls a  thought robot was the last great gift of  dak's novu and is said to be capable of  adapting to meet any future threat and  designed to save all existence against  the ultimate enemy and so the superman  robot is then confronted by mandrak  who's holding up a capsule filled with  the bleed which superman needs in order  to heal lois and then challenges him to  come and take it from him so as they  begin fighting mandrak reveals that he  is powered by the blood of 52 universes  and the heat of 10 billion suns  indicating that he's already destroyed  all of those universes now as the battle  between them goes on mandrak grows  increasingly stronger and the thought  robot increases in power to match him  and so as they fight civilization and  all of reality crumbles around them and  superman finally discovers the true  origin of mandrak and that dax novu had  not sacrificed himself to imprison  mandrak but that mandrak was daksnovu  himself of course superman seemingly  defeats mandrak but the battle does  enough damage to the thought robot that  is ultimately destroyed so that's the  origin of mandrake like i said pretty  convoluted but let's get into his power  so mandrak is the most powerful of all  the monitors and after becoming addicted  to the bleed he essentially becomes a  vampire that has a constant thirst for  the bleed now like we said earlier he  produces energy beams that have the heat  of 10 billion suns and he also has the  ability to fly he's telepathic and can  grow in power as needed to fight any  enemy as we saw with his battle with the  thought robot mandrake can not only  alter reality but can also go beyond  that and eliminate complete narratives  from existence but not only can he erase  someone from existence like any reality  warper basically could he couldn't make  it so entire realities had never existed  in the first place so for those of you  guys coming from marvel comics he's  basically a living ultimate nullifier  but to get an idea of how powerful  mandrak is we need only look at what  happens when he returns at the end of  final crisis so after darkseid is  defeated mandrak shows up to confront  superman and his minion ultraman who be  turned into a vampire and is carrying  the bodies of the spectre and the  radiant and the fact that he was able to  defeat and feed on these two entities is  absolutely insane you probably know  about the spectre who is the embodiment  of god's vengeance in the dc universe  but you may not have heard of the  radiant who's the embodiment of god's  mercy so they're basically two sides of  the same coin and are both divine  avatars that have an insane power level  and of course mandrak is eventually  defeated but it takes the combined might  of superman from dozens of different  universes the green lantern corps the  zoo crew which has captain carrot  captain carrot i love captain karen  captain carrots a super bunny  [Laughter]  but it takes captain carrot the zoo crew  which is basically an  animal version of the justice league the  mandrake son nexuotin another member of  the monitor race all of them to take  mandrak out so the fact that it takes  that much firepower to destroy mandrak  lets us know that he is far far beyond  omega level and just as a bonus right  just as like an aside if you're  wondering how it is that he's eventually  defeated it's because with him being a  vampire he has a stake made of green  light from hal jordan's ring driven  through his chest which is admittedly a  pretty badass way to die but i think  that's the simplest i can make man drag  i mean he's insanely powerful but i  doubt that we'll ever see him used again  in dc comics right i mean i 